{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0331A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"为了祖国自由而革命吗。看来我们两个都和和平无缘啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"AUX_PEACE_OBJECTIVE_MISREAD_CORRECTED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"虽非我所愿，但也没办法。毫不反抗，只会任人剥削。祖国过去的历史已经证明了这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPLOITATION_AND_HISTORY_DETAILS_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"当然，革命只是手段，不是目的。革命成功以后，我也想让国家变得和平。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_SECOND_SENTENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"但要带来和平，首先就必须清除那些卖国贼。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"“我们发动战争，是为了生活在和平之中”——这话从很久以前就有人说了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"谁说的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"亚里士多德。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"你懂得真多。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"是某个人教我的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"AUX_GOOD_TEACHER_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"也就是说，人类从很久以前就在重复同样的事……即便如此，也只能战斗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"是啊。既然有目标，就只能继续向前。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}